---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={"WINSERV | Solutions"}
  description={"Cloud Computing, Communication Solutions and Monitoring — tailor-made IT projects for your company."}
  path={"/en/solutions.html"}
  ogTitle={"Solutions — WINSERV"}
  ogDescription={"Cloud Computing, Communication Solutions and Monitoring — tailor-made IT projects for your company."}
  ogType={"website"}
  active={"solucoes"}
>
<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="section-label">Products and Services</div>
  <h1>Tailor-made IT solutions</h1>
  <p>Ways to help your company take part in Industry 4.0 safely and efficiently.</p>
</div>


<section class="sol-section" id="cloud">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sol-inner">
      <div class="sol-content">
        <div class="sol-badge">&#9729; Infrastructure</div>
        <h2>Cloud Computing</h2>
        <p>Software keeps evolving, and with it the demand for hardware — memory, processing and capacity that many companies cannot provide on site without constant spending on maintenance and configuration.</p>
        <p>Winserv uses leading technology to <b>virtualize computers and servers</b> with services from giants such as <b>Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, Amazon AWS, Oracle Cloud and DigitalOcean</b> — platforms we know well and have proven experience with.</p>
        <p>Our solutions are for companies that want modern, agile operations, to <b>avoid the typical problems of physical installations and cut IT infrastructure costs</b>.</p>
        <div class="sol-proposal">
          <h4>What we offer</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Agility and security for your systems and servers</li>
            <li>Implementation fitted to your specific needs</li>
            <li>Flexibility across several hosting models</li>
            <li>Affordable pricing shaped around your operation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sol-img">
        <img src="/images/cloudhosting.webp" alt="Cloud Computing" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="sol-section alt" id="comms">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sol-inner img-left">
      <div class="sol-content">
        <div class="sol-badge">&#128222; Communication</div>
        <h2>Communication Solutions</h2>
        <p>Video conferences without installing complex apps, calls without maintaining rigid plans, communication systems for remote work and internal chat to keep personal and professional life apart.</p>
        <p>Here at Winserv we make these ideas real with <b>3CX</b> — much more than VoIP or SIP telephony. It is a <b>complete internal and external communication solution</b>, so your company does not depend on several systems with multiple configurations and different plans.</p>
        <p>With broad knowledge of network configuration, IP telephony and VoIP infrastructure management, we deliver a complete and efficient solution for companies in every field.</p>
        <div class="sol-proposal">
          <h4>What we offer</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Streamline your company's organization and communication</li>
            <li>Simplify old, complicated telephony setups</li>
            <li>Break free from outdated carriers and confusing plans</li>
            <li>Give you full control of your phones and channels</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sol-img">
        <img src="/images/webchatting.webp" alt="Communication Solutions" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="sol-section" id="monitor">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sol-inner">
      <div class="sol-content">
        <div class="sol-badge">&#128202; Security</div>
        <h2>Monitoring and Auditing</h2>
        <p>Does your company follow international security and IT infrastructure recommendations? Are your computing resources being used in the best way? Can you see every application installed on your network?</p>
        <p>Many companies have questions about new data protection laws, especially Brazil's <b>LGPD</b>. That is why we built an auditing, compliance and security review service that replaces arbitrary consulting with measurable results.</p>
        <p>Winserv has managed networks and IT structures since it started operating, with proven experience in tools that <b>optimize resources and deliver more results with less investment</b>.</p>
        <div class="sol-proposal">
          <h4>What we offer</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Improve how your computing resources are used</li>
            <li>Provide full oversight of your business and equipment</li>
            <li>Bring your company technically and legally into the digital age</li>
            <li>Cut spending on vague consulting without clear results</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sol-img">
        <img src="/images/monitoring.webp" alt="Monitoring and Auditing" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="cta-strip">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Have another problem?</h2>
    <p>Winserv looks at any case involving network management, IT infrastructure or similar situations. Our experience lets us work across many areas while always focusing on practical results.</p>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="/en/contact.html">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
